data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/plan.md\", \"content\": \"# Plan for m1: greet, tested\\n\\nSingle small task, single teammate (dev). No decomposition needed.\\n\\n1. Dispatch full spec to dev:\\n   - src/greet.py: greet(name) -\u003e \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"\\n   - tests/test_greet.py: unittest covering a normal name and the empty string\\n   - Verify locally: python3 -m unittest discover -s tests exits 0\\n   - Commit to dev's own branch before replying\\n2. Wait for dev's reply.\\n3. Judge by fetching dev's branch (not just trusting the report):\\n   - src/greet.py exists and greet() returns the exact format \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"\\n   - tests/test_greet.py exists, covers a normal name and \\\"\\\" empty string\\n   - Run python3 -m unittest discover -s tests myself against the fetched branch; must exit 0\\n4. If all three criteria met: accept dev, reply to mission with campaign-met.\\n   If not: send precise rework describing exactly what's wrong, repeat.\\n   Mission notes this is small — if it stalls, wrap up honestly (campaign-converged/exhausted/blocked as appropriate) rather than looping forever.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

